WEBVTT

00:00:53.750 --> 00:01:03.750
"Assault Lily
BOUQUET"

00:02:15.200 --> 00:02:16.950
"Present time"

00:02:21.370 --> 00:02:23.370
"Uniform"
"CHARM"
"Student handbook"

00:02:25.540 --> 00:02:27.120
Nice to meet you.

00:02:27.120 --> 00:02:29.910
My name's Hitotsuyanagi Riri.

00:02:29.910 --> 00:02:31.540
That's "<i>hitotsuyanagi</i>" meaning "one willow,"

00:02:31.540 --> 00:02:34.410
"<i>ri</i>" meaning "pear" and "<i>ri</i>" meaning "azure":

00:02:34.410 --> 00:02:36.330
Hitotsuyanagi Riri!

00:02:39.540 --> 00:02:44.080
Today is the Yurigaoka Girls' Academy
entrance ceremony! I can hardly wait.

00:02:44.080 --> 00:02:48.450
As everyone knows, it's one of the
most prestigious Lily training facilities.

00:02:48.450 --> 00:02:50.370
Can you believe it?

00:02:50.370 --> 00:02:51.410
Yes,

00:02:51.410 --> 00:02:53.830
I'm going to become a Lily!

00:02:53.830 --> 00:02:58.830
"Episode 1"

00:02:59.000 --> 00:03:01.790
Oh, I got a bit overexcited.

00:03:01.790 --> 00:03:04.790
"Riri" and "Lily" kind of
sound alike, don't they?

00:03:04.790 --> 00:03:06.870
I used to get teased for that a lot,

00:03:06.870 --> 00:03:09.200
but that's all in the past now!

00:03:09.200 --> 00:03:11.950
Oh, sorry. I got sidetracked.

00:03:11.950 --> 00:03:16.790
"When you get an alert, head for high ground!"

00:03:11.950 --> 00:03:16.790
Lilies are our last hope to resist
humanity's enemy, the Huge,

00:03:16.790 --> 00:03:21.000
"When you get an alert, head for high ground!"

00:03:16.790 --> 00:03:21.000
which suddenly appeared all over
the world around 50 years ago.

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:22.080
which suddenly appeared all over
the world around 50 years ago.

00:03:22.080 --> 00:03:27.000
We're students, but we also
have a duty to fight the Huge.

00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:27.660
"Student Handbook"

00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:27.660
We're students, but we also
have a duty to fight the Huge.

00:03:27.660 --> 00:03:29.000
"Student Handbook"

00:03:27.660 --> 00:03:29.000
The Huge are...

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:29.660
The Huge are...

00:03:36.370 --> 00:03:38.700
That's a Huge nest.

00:04:07.290 --> 00:04:14.450
"Danger zone: authorized personnel only"

00:04:14.450 --> 00:04:16.830
"Danger zone: authorized personnel only"

00:04:14.450 --> 00:04:16.830
Now, where was I?

00:04:16.830 --> 00:04:18.250
Oh, yeah!

00:04:18.250 --> 00:04:22.120
The Huge are super scary monsters.

00:04:22.120 --> 00:04:24.950
They emerge from their nests and attack people.

00:04:24.950 --> 00:04:26.950
They're our enemies.

00:04:29.200 --> 00:04:31.200
Ah!

00:04:31.200 --> 00:04:34.950
I took the train from
my home in Koshu this morning,

00:04:34.950 --> 00:04:38.500
but everyone else must already
be moved into the dorms by now.

00:04:38.500 --> 00:04:43.040
It seems like I'm a just little less
on the ball than the others,

00:04:43.040 --> 00:04:47.250
so I was admitted, well... from the waitlist.

00:04:47.250 --> 00:04:48.910
But I don't mind.

00:04:48.910 --> 00:04:51.370
Either way, I still got in!

00:04:51.370 --> 00:04:54.830
I'm going to become a Lily and fight the Huge!

00:04:54.830 --> 00:04:58.160
Look, I can see the academy now.

00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:07.250
Now for my momentous first step!

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:16.080
I can open the door for myself.

00:05:16.080 --> 00:05:20.200
I'll have to look after myself
from now on, after all.

00:05:21.450 --> 00:05:23.120
Oh?

00:05:23.120 --> 00:05:24.500
How do you do?

00:05:24.500 --> 00:05:25.700
Huh?!

00:05:25.700 --> 00:05:29.080
You may go now.

00:05:29.080 --> 00:05:31.540
Huh? But I just got here, and--

00:05:31.540 --> 00:05:35.410
But I already told them that
I don't require a companion.

00:05:35.410 --> 00:05:36.950
C-Companion?!

00:05:36.950 --> 00:05:38.040
No!

00:05:38.040 --> 00:05:42.620
I'm a bona fide new student
at Yurigaoka Girls' Academy!

00:05:44.330 --> 00:05:48.660
Well, they say that even a chance
meeting can lead to a deep bond.

00:05:48.660 --> 00:05:51.750
My name is Kaede Johan Nouvel.

00:05:51.750 --> 00:05:54.370
I'm Hitotsuyanagi Riri!

00:05:55.790 --> 00:05:59.620
I know you're a Lily;
you don't have to announce it.

00:05:59.620 --> 00:06:02.500
N-No, my name is Riri!

00:06:02.500 --> 00:06:03.160
Oh!

00:06:03.160 --> 00:06:03.540
"Yurigaoka Girls' Academy entrance ceremony"

00:06:03.160 --> 00:06:03.540
Oh!

00:06:03.540 --> 00:06:05.040
"Yurigaoka Girls' Academy entrance ceremony"

00:06:03.540 --> 00:06:05.040
You're Riri the Lily, then.

00:06:05.040 --> 00:06:05.500
"Congratulations, new students"

00:06:05.040 --> 00:06:05.500
You're Riri the Lily, then.

00:06:05.500 --> 00:06:08.580
"Congratulations, new students"

00:06:05.500 --> 00:06:08.580
I suppose that makes you a natural-born Lily.

00:06:08.580 --> 00:06:13.330
No, I, uh, only set my mind on it last year.

00:06:14.620 --> 00:06:17.950
I haven't seen you since junior high, Miss Yuyu.

00:06:17.950 --> 00:06:20.580
Do you need something, Endo?

00:06:20.580 --> 00:06:23.580
Won't you call me Araya?

00:06:23.580 --> 00:06:28.750
And I'd like to try out our CHARMs
to celebrate the new school year.

00:06:28.750 --> 00:06:30.580
I'm finally here.

00:06:30.580 --> 00:06:33.750
Or so I thought, but what's that about?

00:06:33.750 --> 00:06:38.160
Probably a hot-headed Lily picking
a fight with an upperclassman.

00:06:38.160 --> 00:06:39.330
What?

00:06:39.330 --> 00:06:42.250
Lilies fighting each other with CHARMs?

00:06:42.250 --> 00:06:46.910
Lilies are still 16- or
17-year-old girls, after all.

00:06:49.040 --> 00:06:51.290
Oh, my, is that...?!

00:06:58.450 --> 00:07:00.200
It's Shirai Yuyu!

00:07:00.200 --> 00:07:02.450
Farewell, Riri.

00:07:02.450 --> 00:07:03.290
Huh?

00:07:03.290 --> 00:07:06.450
What does Araya think
she's doing with Miss Yuyu?

00:07:06.450 --> 00:07:09.040
She's picking a fight with her, Ichi.

00:07:09.040 --> 00:07:11.120
Shall we stop her, Soraha?

00:07:11.120 --> 00:07:13.540
I think it might be interesting.

00:07:13.540 --> 00:07:15.700
Shall we watch, then?

00:07:15.700 --> 00:07:17.080
E-Excuse me!

00:07:17.080 --> 00:07:17.700
--Huh?

00:07:17.700 --> 00:07:18.290
--Was that Kaede Johan Nouvel?
--Huh?

00:07:18.290 --> 00:07:20.410
--Was that Kaede Johan Nouvel?

00:07:20.410 --> 00:07:21.500
Y-Yeah.

00:07:21.500 --> 00:07:26.120
Her father is the head of the famous
CHARM manufacturer Grand Guignol,

00:07:26.120 --> 00:07:28.410
and she's also a talented Lily herself!

00:07:28.410 --> 00:07:29.750
I-I see.

00:07:29.750 --> 00:07:32.040
That's Endo Araya.

00:07:32.040 --> 00:07:35.000
She's been earning her reputation
as a Lily since junior high!

00:07:35.000 --> 00:07:40.330
The other one is an aloof Lily who
doesn't belong to any legion, Shirai Yuyu!

00:07:40.330 --> 00:07:42.080
You know a lot about Lilies.

00:07:42.080 --> 00:07:46.040
Anyone who follows the Ministry
of Defense newsletter knows this much.

00:07:46.040 --> 00:07:49.700
Oh, I'm Futagawa Fumi.

00:07:50.830 --> 00:07:57.500
It looks like Ms. Nouvel might be planning to
make a Schutzengel pledge with Miss Yuyu.

00:07:57.500 --> 00:07:59.540
A Schutzengel, huh.

00:07:59.540 --> 00:08:02.950
Do you look up to anyone that way, Futagawa?

00:08:02.950 --> 00:08:04.370
Fumi is fine!

00:08:04.370 --> 00:08:09.450
A useless waitlist admittee like me
could never hope to have a Schutzengel.

00:08:09.450 --> 00:08:11.250
Don't worry about it.

00:08:11.250 --> 00:08:12.870
I was wait-listed, too.

00:08:12.870 --> 00:08:16.250
Oh, I know. Hitotsuyanagi Riri.

00:08:16.250 --> 00:08:18.000
Just Riri is fine.

00:08:19.330 --> 00:08:20.540
Miss Yuyu!

00:08:20.540 --> 00:08:21.580
Please move.

00:08:21.580 --> 00:08:23.410
You're wasting your time.

00:08:23.410 --> 00:08:27.330
In that case, I'll help you get in the mood.

00:08:47.370 --> 00:08:49.450
She drew her CHARM!

00:08:49.450 --> 00:08:51.450
I won't hold back.

00:08:51.450 --> 00:08:53.120
Oh, I'm <i>so </i>scared.

00:08:53.120 --> 00:08:54.870
I might get chills.

00:08:54.870 --> 00:08:58.200
All right, that's quite enough.

00:08:58.200 --> 00:09:01.790
I'll thank you not to start things without me.

00:09:01.790 --> 00:09:03.750
Who are you supposed to be?

00:09:03.750 --> 00:09:06.040
It's an honor to make your acquaintance.

00:09:06.040 --> 00:09:10.120
My name is Kaede Johan Nouvel.

00:09:10.120 --> 00:09:16.040
I hope that you will one day consent
to be my Schutzengel, Miss Yuyu.

00:09:16.040 --> 00:09:19.540
This is none of your business!

00:09:19.540 --> 00:09:23.040
Or are you Miss Yuyu's opening act?

00:09:23.040 --> 00:09:24.910
Fine by me.

00:09:27.290 --> 00:09:28.830
If you please.

00:09:31.500 --> 00:09:34.080
N-Not you, too, Kaede!

00:09:37.950 --> 00:09:41.040
Huh? Riri, when did you...?

00:09:41.040 --> 00:09:43.500
Sprightly, isn't she?

00:09:43.500 --> 00:09:44.370
"Sprightly"?

00:09:44.370 --> 00:09:47.200
Still, one wrong step could spell her doom.

00:09:47.200 --> 00:09:51.450
M-Miriam Hildegard von Gropius?!

00:09:53.580 --> 00:09:56.830
I can't believe she managed
to get so close to me.

00:09:56.830 --> 00:09:58.950
Lilies shouldn't fight each other!

00:09:58.950 --> 00:10:01.290
Don't get in the way of my chance to shine!

00:10:01.290 --> 00:10:02.700
I said it's wrong!

00:10:02.700 --> 00:10:06.000
You're the ones who are in the way!

00:10:06.000 --> 00:10:08.250
Fine. This is tiresome.

00:10:08.250 --> 00:10:09.830
All three of you attack together.

00:10:09.830 --> 00:10:10.250
--Me, too?!

00:10:10.250 --> 00:10:11.410
--Um, no, I'm on your side, Miss Yuyu.
--Me, too?!

00:10:11.410 --> 00:10:14.160
--Um, no, I'm on your side, Miss Yuyu.

00:10:14.160 --> 00:10:18.200
Oh, just look at me, Miss Yuyu!

00:10:21.790 --> 00:10:25.160
What do you all think you're doing?!

00:10:25.160 --> 00:10:27.330
This is no time for horseplay.

00:10:27.330 --> 00:10:30.000
An on-campus research facility

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:33.750
just reported that a live
Huge specimen has escaped.

00:10:33.750 --> 00:10:37.700
We need everyone able
to sortie to help capture it.

00:10:37.700 --> 00:10:39.540
Understood.

00:10:39.540 --> 00:10:41.540
Wait, Yuyu.

00:10:41.540 --> 00:10:44.000
Independent action is prohibited.

00:10:44.000 --> 00:10:45.000
Why?

00:10:45.000 --> 00:10:49.330
We have a report that this
Huge mimics its surroundings.

00:10:49.330 --> 00:10:51.950
You must operate in pairs.

00:10:51.950 --> 00:10:53.750
Let me see.

00:10:53.750 --> 00:10:56.450
You, go with Yuyu.

00:10:56.450 --> 00:10:58.250
Y-Yes, ma'am!

00:10:58.250 --> 00:10:59.870
That won't be necessary.

00:10:59.870 --> 00:11:02.370
She'll slow me down.

00:11:02.370 --> 00:11:06.370
Don't you need someone to slow you down?

00:11:06.370 --> 00:11:08.950
My fight!

00:11:08.950 --> 00:11:09.700
--Let's go, Araya.

00:11:09.700 --> 00:11:10.910
--Hey, I didn't get to fight at all!
--Let's go, Araya.

00:11:10.910 --> 00:11:11.540
--Hey, I didn't get to fight at all!

00:11:11.540 --> 00:11:14.580
--Hey, I didn't get to fight at all!
--Those without combat
experience, go to the gym.

00:11:14.580 --> 00:11:16.910
I-I'll go with you!

00:11:16.910 --> 00:11:18.500
What?!

00:11:18.500 --> 00:11:20.410
I want to help!

00:11:24.950 --> 00:11:26.540
Come.

00:11:26.540 --> 00:11:29.910
Oh, please wait for me.

00:11:29.910 --> 00:11:33.910
Umm, my name is Hitotsuyanagi Riri.

00:11:35.700 --> 00:11:37.660
Still, she used to be

00:11:37.660 --> 00:11:40.370
a lot nicer.

00:11:41.790 --> 00:11:45.910
Oh! W-Wait for me!

00:11:56.870 --> 00:12:00.700
I wonder where Riri went.

00:12:00.700 --> 00:12:06.040
She couldn't have gone to
capture the Huge, could she?

00:12:06.040 --> 00:12:09.950
If it weren't for Riri,
I'd be alone with Miss Yuyu.

00:12:09.950 --> 00:12:12.410
If it weren't for Riri...

00:12:13.620 --> 00:12:15.250
Wow.

00:12:15.250 --> 00:12:18.500
Is this damage from a battle with Huge?

00:12:18.500 --> 00:12:24.120
The academy actively lures
Huge to attack from the sea.

00:12:24.120 --> 00:12:27.250
The landscape is a natural fortress,

00:12:27.250 --> 00:12:31.620
which prevents damage
from spreading to nearby cities.

00:12:34.580 --> 00:12:37.000
What is this path?

00:12:37.000 --> 00:12:41.410
It was cut through the hills
roughly 1,000 years ago.

00:12:42.750 --> 00:12:45.580
I suppose this will make a good history lesson.

00:12:50.700 --> 00:12:53.950
I've completely exhausted myself
before the entrance ceremony.

00:12:57.080 --> 00:12:59.540
We haven't found anything, huh?

00:13:03.250 --> 00:13:05.870
Should we go a little farther in?

00:13:05.870 --> 00:13:09.500
Maybe it isn't in this area.

00:13:09.500 --> 00:13:10.830
Hitotsuyanagi!

00:13:10.830 --> 00:13:12.790
Huh?

00:13:12.790 --> 00:13:15.620
Th-There it is!

00:13:15.620 --> 00:13:17.660
Move, Riri!

00:13:21.040 --> 00:13:22.870
It's not working?!

00:13:36.410 --> 00:13:41.200
You can't even use a CHARM!
What were you planning to do?

00:13:44.950 --> 00:13:47.160
I'm sorry, I...

00:13:47.160 --> 00:13:53.370
No, it's my fault for failing to realize
how inexperienced Hitotsuyanagi is.

00:13:53.370 --> 00:13:54.790
That's...

00:13:54.790 --> 00:13:58.870
Be that as it may,
you should still be more cautious.

00:13:59.700 --> 00:14:01.700
"No signal"
"0 new messages"

00:14:02.330 --> 00:14:05.450
Please stand lookout for a short while.

00:14:05.450 --> 00:14:06.290
Huh?

00:14:06.290 --> 00:14:08.040
O-Of course.

00:14:08.040 --> 00:14:11.370
You haven't made a pact with
your CHARM yet, have you?

00:14:11.370 --> 00:14:14.410
I'll do that for you now,
albeit a simplified version.

00:14:14.410 --> 00:14:16.290
All right.

00:14:19.040 --> 00:14:20.160
It must hurt.

00:14:20.160 --> 00:14:22.660
No, I'm fine.

00:14:22.660 --> 00:14:24.910
Miss Yuyu, my blood--

00:14:24.910 --> 00:14:26.700
That's fine.

00:14:31.120 --> 00:14:36.040
It's simplified, but this is the proper way.

00:14:36.040 --> 00:14:40.910
Your Magie is flowing into
your CHARM through your ring.

00:14:40.910 --> 00:14:42.700
My Magie...

00:14:44.700 --> 00:14:46.200
It's here!

00:15:06.950 --> 00:15:08.370
Gas?!

00:15:09.700 --> 00:15:12.290
Don't worry; it's just a smoke screen!

00:15:12.290 --> 00:15:17.200
Now I won't be able to show off for Miss Yuyu!

00:15:18.250 --> 00:15:22.040
Don't let go of your CHARM until it activates.

00:15:22.040 --> 00:15:23.910
Right.

00:15:23.910 --> 00:15:26.160
How long will that be, Miss Yuyu?

00:15:26.160 --> 00:15:28.160
You'll know when the time comes.

00:15:30.450 --> 00:15:32.200
Wait!

00:15:33.750 --> 00:15:35.200
Miss Yuyu!

00:15:48.290 --> 00:15:51.000
I'm so sorry, Miss Yuyu.

00:15:51.000 --> 00:15:54.830
That Huge was trying to make us hit each other.

00:15:54.830 --> 00:15:57.580
It can't be! Can a Huge be that intelligent?

00:15:57.580 --> 00:16:00.160
You should thank Hitotsuyanagi.

00:16:01.250 --> 00:16:04.080
If she hadn't stopped me,

00:16:04.080 --> 00:16:07.120
you would be sliced in two by now.

00:16:08.580 --> 00:16:11.000
You have good eyes.

00:16:11.000 --> 00:16:14.870
I'm from the country,
so I'm confident in my eyesight.

00:16:16.540 --> 00:16:18.000
What's that?!

00:16:33.950 --> 00:16:35.750
Miss Yuyu!

00:16:50.950 --> 00:16:52.580
Do it in one strike!

00:16:52.580 --> 00:16:55.120
You can do that much, can't you?

00:16:55.120 --> 00:16:56.450
Yeah!

00:17:23.080 --> 00:17:24.410
Kaede!

00:17:24.410 --> 00:17:25.450
Huh?

00:17:30.040 --> 00:17:31.370
Riri!

00:17:38.370 --> 00:17:41.370
"Quarantine"

00:17:42.120 --> 00:17:45.910
That cut will leave a scar.

00:17:45.910 --> 00:17:49.660
Now I'll never forget what happened today.

00:17:51.910 --> 00:17:55.200
You changed your CHARM, didn't you, Miss Yuyu?

00:17:56.910 --> 00:18:03.870
Two years ago, you saved me
during the evacuation of Koshu.

00:18:06.330 --> 00:18:08.290
Riri, I'm scared!

00:18:08.290 --> 00:18:10.790
Don't stop! Keep running!

00:18:17.620 --> 00:18:19.910
Take care of these girls!

00:18:19.910 --> 00:18:21.660
Those are Lilies.

00:18:23.330 --> 00:18:25.660
What's this light?

00:18:25.660 --> 00:18:28.450
You can still run, right?

00:18:30.370 --> 00:18:33.120
There are reinforcements just over there.

00:18:33.120 --> 00:18:36.080
Take your friend and run straight ahead.

00:18:36.080 --> 00:18:37.830
O-Okay.

00:18:37.830 --> 00:18:39.330
Come on, let's run.

00:18:39.330 --> 00:18:41.950
Don't worry; the Lilies will protect us.

00:18:41.950 --> 00:18:43.200
Okay.

00:18:44.200 --> 00:18:45.830
U-Umm!

00:18:47.370 --> 00:18:49.250
Take care!

00:18:51.620 --> 00:18:53.410
Thank you.

00:18:56.040 --> 00:18:59.250
I knew you were a Lily from Yurigaoka,

00:18:59.250 --> 00:19:01.870
but that's all I knew.

00:19:02.910 --> 00:19:05.200
Don't tell me that's the
only reason you're here.

00:19:05.200 --> 00:19:07.120
Yup.

00:19:07.120 --> 00:19:09.000
I got wait-listed, though.

00:19:09.000 --> 00:19:12.000
Reckless through and through I see.

00:19:12.000 --> 00:19:14.330
I can't believe I got to meet you so soon.

00:19:14.330 --> 00:19:16.620
It's a dream come true.

00:19:18.200 --> 00:19:24.200
But compared to two years ago,
you seem kind of...

00:19:25.450 --> 00:19:28.500
No, it's nothing.

00:19:28.500 --> 00:19:32.410
I've got to thank that other Lily, too.

00:19:35.540 --> 00:19:36.620
"Quarantine"

00:19:38.950 --> 00:19:40.540
Hey there.

00:19:40.540 --> 00:19:43.120
Sorry, you two.

00:19:45.120 --> 00:19:48.450
Nice to meet you. I'm Mashima Moyu.

00:19:48.450 --> 00:19:52.500
I accidentally let that Huge specimen get loose.

00:19:52.500 --> 00:19:57.200
I never expected it to break
through 50-cm-thick concrete.

00:19:57.200 --> 00:19:58.870
That was careless of you.

00:19:58.870 --> 00:20:01.870
They always defy our expectations.

00:20:01.870 --> 00:20:05.450
These aren't easy enemies we're up against.

00:20:05.450 --> 00:20:07.540
That's why we have Lilies, right?

00:20:07.540 --> 00:20:11.410
Of course, I am grateful
to you and this girl, Yuyu.

00:20:11.410 --> 00:20:13.290
