00:20:49.000 --> 00:20:53.330
I'm really not a loose woman.

00:20:53.330 --> 00:20:55.000
Forgive me, Miss Yuyu.

00:20:55.000 --> 00:20:58.950
I've found the girl of my destiny.

00:20:58.950 --> 00:21:01.120
Please, don't mind me.

